            '<div class="d">Price ' + fmtP(x.price, x.sym) + ' · 3 min ' + pct(x.r3) + ' · 5 min ' + pct(x.r5) + ' · 15 min ' + pct(x.r15) + ' · 1 hour ' + pct(x.r60) + '<br>Volume ×' + x.vr.toFixed(1) + ' vs its normal · day ' + pct(x.chg24) + '</div>' +
